# Mathua CAT Diagnostic  --  information gain over a compressed covering set

direction: down

Start: Start Diagnostic\nConcepts in topological order\nEvery learner starts UNSEEN

Cover: Build compressed cover\nroots + evenly spaced\ntarget 30 concepts

Loop: Assessment Loop {
  Score: Score candidates\nuncertainty x coverage influence

  Pick: Pick highest info gain\nnot yet covered

  Question: Generate Question\nfor chosen concept

  Answer: Student Answers\ngraded with evidence

  Decision: Record evidence\npropagate +-0.3 to neighbours

}

Score -> Pick
Pick -> Question
Question -> Answer
Answer -> Decision
Decision -> Stop
Decision -> Score: next

Stop: Stop when\ncover done AND asked >= 25,\nor asked >= 45

Supplemental: Supplemental probe\nwhen confidence < 0.7

Frontier: Frontier at\nlargest belief drop

Result: Frontier located\ngaps by domain\ncompletion estimates

Done: Diagnostic Complete\nMerge with existing progress\noptimistic merge

# Flow
Start -> Cover
Cover -> Loop
Stop -> Supplemental: confidence < 0.7
Stop -> Frontier: No
Supplemental -> Frontier
Frontier -> Result
Result -> Done

# Side note
Note: "Key Parameters: compressed covering set (30), info-gain selection, 25-45 questions"

# Styling
nodes: {
  style: {
    font-size: 12
    border-radius: 6
  }
}

edges: {
  style: {
    stroke: "#6b6a64"
    font-size: 10
  }
}
